"""Original bilingual lessons, adapted from official AE2 GuideME topics to AE2S 1.1.0.

Each lesson is one Markdown source per language, compiled by Ponder for both presentations.
Fields: topic, category, components, (English title, Chinese title), official reference,
steps: (English heading, Chinese heading, English narration, Chinese narration, focus position).
"""
NEW = [
('charger','basics',['charger','crank','charged_certus_quartz_crystal'],('Charging Certus Quartz','赛特斯石英充能'),'items-blocks-machines/charger.md',[
('Power the charger','为充能器供能','Place the Charger beside the powered cable. Early on, attach a Wooden Crank and turn it by hand; an Energy Cell only buffers energy.','把充能器连接到供能线缆。前期可在充能器上装木制曲柄手动转动；能量元件只能储能。',[4,1,2]),
('Insert a crystal','放入石英','Open the Charger and insert Certus Quartz Crystal. Wait for the Charged Certus Quartz Crystal, then remove the result. Use the installed recipe viewer if the pack changes the input.','打开充能器放入赛特斯石英水晶，等待其变为充能赛特斯石英水晶后取出。整合包改动配方时以实际配方查看器为准。',[4,1,2]),
('Automate input and output','连接输入输出','Use a processing pattern for the charging recipe and a Pattern Provider to deliver the input. Return the charged result with an Import Bus or a separate transport subnet.','用处理样板描述充能配方，由样板供应器投入原料，再用输入总线或独立运输子网络回收充能产物。',[4,1,3]),
('Check a full cycle','验收一个完整循环','Request one charged crystal before scaling up. Confirm power, allowed machine sides, and product return to the requesting network. The diagram illustrates the sequence; it does not run machine recipes.','扩大生产前先请求一颗充能水晶，确认供电、机器允许的输入输出面以及产物回到发起任务的网络。演示用于说明流程，不在虚拟场景中执行机器配方。',[3,1,3])]),
('processors','crafting',['inscriber','silicon_press','logic_processor_press','calculation_processor_press','engineering_processor_press','logic_processor','calculation_processor','engineering_processor'],('Inscriber and Processor Production','压印器与处理器生产'),'example-setups/processor-automation.md',[
('Keep the presses','保留压印模板','Use the matching press to print a circuit, and the Silicon Press to print silicon. Presses are tools; keep them in their assigned Inscribers. Check JEI for the current materials.','用对应的压印模板制作电路，用硅压印模板制作硅板。模板作为工具保留在指定压印器内，当前原料以 JEI 为准。',[2,1,2]),
('Assemble the processor','合成处理器','A second operation combines the printed circuit, printed silicon and redstone into a processor. Use a separate assembly Inscriber so presses stay in place.','第二道工序将电路、硅板和红石组合为处理器。使用独立的组装压印器，可避免反复移动模板。',[4,1,2]),
('Route to correct slots','按槽位布线','Inscriber automation depends on the accessible slot on each face. Test one item from each pipe or bus, rotate the machine when needed, and extract only the product.','压印器自动化取决于各个面能访问的槽位。逐条管线或总线测试一个物品，必要时旋转机器，并只从成品输出处提取。',[5,1,2]),
('Encode the stages','分阶段编码样板','Encode printing and final assembly as separate processing patterns. List consumed materials and exact products; do not include a press that remains installed. Return every intermediate and final product.','将压印和最终组装分别编码为处理样板，填写消耗的原料和准确产物，不把留在机器里的模板写成每次消耗的材料。中间产物与最终成品都要回网。',[3,1,3]),
('Diagnose a stalled job','排查停滞任务','If crafting waits forever, inspect material stock, power, slot routing, the printed item variant, and extraction. Start with one processor before adding parallel machines or speed upgrades.','若任务一直等待，依次检查原料、供电、槽位路线、印刷电路种类和成品提取。先跑通一个处理器，再增加并行机器或加速升级。',[4,1,3])]),
('quartz_growth','basics',['flawless_budding_quartz','flawed_budding_quartz','chipped_budding_quartz','damaged_budding_quartz','quartz_cluster','growth_accelerator','fluix_crystal'],('Quartz Growth and Fluix Materials','石英生长与福鲁伊克斯材料'),'ae2-mechanics/certus-growth.md',[
('Leave room for buds','为晶芽留出空间','Budding Certus Quartz grows buds on exposed faces. Leave those faces unobstructed and wait for the full cluster before harvesting. Avoid breaking the budding block.','赛特斯石英母岩在裸露面生长晶芽。为这些面留出空间，等到完整晶簇再采收，避免把母岩本体一起破坏。',[2,1,2]),
('Plan for wear','留意母岩损耗','Inspect the budding block tier: flawed, chipped and damaged variants can degrade. Use the actual AE2S recipe viewer to plan replacements or its dedicated crystal machines.','检查母岩等级，有瑕疵、碎裂和损坏的母岩存在降级过程。按 AE2S 实际配方准备替换母岩或使用其专用晶体机器。',[2,2,2]),
('Supply growth energy','为生长加速供能','Place a powered Growth Accelerator next to the growing faces. Keep its cable from blocking the growth space; adding an unpowered accelerator will not help.','在生长面旁放置并供能给生长加速器，同时避免线缆占用晶芽空间；没有供电的加速器不会提供帮助。',[3,1,2]),
('Separate fluix processing','区分福鲁伊克斯工序','Charged Certus Quartz, redstone and Nether Quartz are used by the familiar water conversion recipe when enabled. Check the pack recipe first, collect the Fluix Crystal, and keep the growth farm separate.','启用经典水中转换配方时，需要充能赛特斯石英、红石和下界石英。先核对整合包配方，再收集福鲁伊克斯水晶，并将这条工序与晶芽农场分开。',[4,1,2])]),
('interfaces','automation',['interface','cable_interface'],('Interface Stocking and Insertion','接口备货与回网'),'example-setups/interface-autostocking.md',[
('Connect an interface','连接接口','Connect an ME Interface to the powered network. Its storage slots can receive items from a pipe or machine and insert them into ME storage. Leave a valid storage destination.','将 ME 接口连接到供能网络，管道或机器可向接口的存储槽投入物品并送入 ME 存储；网络必须存在可接收的存储位置。',[5,1,3]),
('Set desired stock','设置期望库存','Put ghost filter entries and quantities in the configuration slots. The interface keeps that local stock available by requesting it from network storage. Configuration entries are not real supplied items.','在配置槽中设置物品和数量，接口会从网络存储补充本地库存。配置槽里的标记不是已经提供的真实物品。',[5,1,3]),
('Consume locally','从本地库存取用','Let an adjacent machine or pipe consume the stocked items. Verify it reads the intended interface inventory, then watch replenishment. Keep extraction paths from feeding the same items straight back.','让相邻机器或管道消耗备货物品，确认其读取的是目标接口库存，再观察补货。避免取出路线将同批物品立即送回而形成循环。',[5,1,2]),
('Request missing stock','按需合成缺货物品','A supported Crafting Card can let the interface request craftable stock. The network still needs valid patterns, available ingredients and a Crafting CPU. Use a Pattern Provider for processing-pattern output.','接口支持的合成卡可用于请求能够自动合成的备货物品。网络仍需有效样板、可用原料和合成 CPU；向机器发送处理样板原料应使用样板供应器。',[3,1,3])]),
('level_stocking','automation',['level_emitter','redstone_card','export_bus'],('Stock Control with a Level Emitter','用存储监控发信器控制库存'),'example-setups/level-emitter-autostocking.md',[
('Choose the observed item','选择监控物品','Configure a Level Emitter with the desired item and a threshold, such as 64 iron ingots. Choose whether it emits above or below that amount. Test the boundary with a small stock.','为存储监控发信器选择目标物品和阈值，例如 64 个铁锭，并选择高于或低于阈值时发信。先用少量库存测试边界。',[4,1,3]),
('Enable bus redstone control','启用总线红石控制','Install a Redstone Card in the bus when required, then select its redstone mode. An emitter only supplies a signal; the receiving device must be configured to use it.','按需给总线安装红石卡，并设置红石控制模式。发信器只负责提供信号，接收信号的设备必须配置为按信号工作。',[5,1,3]),
('Return the product','让成品回到网络','For production stocking, use the signal to enable ingredient export or the machine, then import finished goods into the same monitored storage. Exporting the finished item merely moves stock elsewhere.','生产备货应通过信号启停原料输出或机器，再把成品导回被监控的存储。直接输出成品只是转移现有库存。',[5,1,5]),
('Allow for in-flight items','考虑在途物品','Machines and pipes can still contain ingredients when the threshold is crossed. Expect some overproduction; use buffers, batch limits, or interface stocking when an exact local amount is needed.','达到阈值时机器和管道里可能仍有原料，因此会继续产出一部分成品。需要精确本地数量时可使用缓冲、批量限制或接口备货。',[3,1,3])]),
('subnetworks','networks',['quartz_fiber','storage_bus','interface'],('Independent Networks and Shared Power','独立子网络与共享电力'),'ae2-mechanics/subnetworks.md',[
('Split the connections','切断网络直连','A subnet is a genuinely separate ME network. Leave a physical gap or use cable colors that do not connect. Check full-block machines too: they can accidentally bridge the gap.','子网络必须在 ME 连接上实际独立。留出物理间隔或使用互不连接的染色线缆，同时检查完整方块机器是否绕过间隔将两边接通。',[3,1,3]),
('Share only energy','仅共享能量','Join the sides with Quartz Fiber to transfer energy without transferring channels or storage access. Each side must still satisfy its own channel limits.','用石英纤维连接两边，可共享能量而不共享频道和存储访问。每个子网络仍要分别满足自己的频道限制。',[4,1,4]),
('Give transport a destination','给运输网络指定目的地','A transport subnet can use an Import Bus at the source and a Storage Bus at the target inventory. Avoid adding an unintended drive that captures the transported items.','运输子网络可在源容器安装输入总线，在目标容器安装存储总线。避免加入不需要的 ME 驱动器，导致搬运物品被截留到磁盘。',[5,1,3]),
('Expose storage deliberately','有目的地暴露存储','A Storage Bus facing an Interface can expose another network through a controlled inventory boundary. Keep the two cable grids separate and avoid a storage path that loops back to its origin.','用存储总线面对接口，可以通过明确的库存边界访问另一网络。两套线缆仍要分离，并避免存储访问路线绕回自身形成循环。',[4,1,3])]),
('cell_io','automation',['io_port','item_storage_cell_1k','fluid_storage_cell_1k'],('Moving Storage Cell Contents','用 IO 端口转移存储元件内容'),'items-blocks-machines/io_port.md',[
('Prepare destination storage','准备目标存储','Connect the ME IO Port and a drive with suitable destination cells. Before emptying a valuable source cell, check free bytes, remaining types, partitions, and resource support.','连接 ME IO 端口和装有目标元件的驱动器。清空贵重源元件前，检查目标的可用字节、类型数量、分区和资源支持。',[2,1,3]),
('Choose direction','选择传输方向','Use the direction control in the IO Port to choose cell-to-network or network-to-cell transfer. Insert the source or destination cell in the input side after checking the arrow.','在 IO 端口中选择元件到网络，或网络到元件的传输方向。确认方向箭头后，再将源元件或目标元件放入输入侧。',[4,1,2]),
('Choose completion behavior','设置完成条件','Choose when the processed cell moves to the output side: empty, full, or work complete. Speed Cards improve transfer throughput; Redstone Cards add redstone controls.','设置处理后的元件何时移到输出侧，例如清空、装满或工作完成。加速卡提升转移速度，红石卡增加红石控制。',[4,1,2]),
('Verify the result','核对转移结果','Remove the output cell and inspect both its tooltip and terminal inventory. Filters or a full destination can stop progress. Never discard a source cell until you have verified its contents were transferred.','取出输出元件，检查元件提示与终端库存。过滤或目标已满都可能让传输停止，确认内容已转移前不要丢弃源元件。',[3,1,3])]),
('wireless','networks',['wireless_access_point','wireless_terminal','wireless_crafting_terminal','wireless_booster'],('Wireless Terminal Pairing','无线终端配对与供能'),'items-blocks-machines/wireless_terminals.md',[
('Connect an access point','连接无线访问点','Connect the Wireless Access Point to the network that owns your storage. Confirm power and channels before pairing a terminal. An access point does not merge independent networks.','将无线访问点接入拥有目标存储的网络，配对前确认供电与频道正常。无线访问点不会自动合并彼此独立的网络。',[4,1,2]),
('Pair through its slot','通过槽位配对','Open the access point. Insert the wireless terminal in its link input slot, then take the paired item from the output slot. AE2S 1.1.0 pairs through this GUI.','打开无线访问点，将无线终端放入配对输入槽，再从输出槽取出已配对的终端。AE2S 1.1.0 使用这个界面完成配对。',[4,1,2]),
('Charge and stay in range','充电并保持在覆盖范围内','Charge the terminal with a Charger or another supported charging method. Open it within access-point range. Range boosters increase coverage and power use; they do not give unlimited range.','用充能器或其他支持的方式给终端充电，并在访问点覆盖范围内打开。无线增程器会同时提高覆盖与耗电，不代表无限距离。',[5,1,2]),
('Diagnose disconnection','排查无法连接','Check the terminal charge, its linked access point, current dimension, distance, and loaded chunks. Moving or removing the bound access point can require pairing again.','检查终端电量、绑定访问点、当前维度、距离和区块加载状态。移动或拆除绑定的访问点后，可能需要重新配对。',[3,1,3])]),
('quantum_bridge','networks',['quantum_ring','quantum_link','quantum_entangled_singularity','singularity'],('Quantum Network Bridge','量子网络桥'),'items-blocks-machines/quantum_bridge.md',[
('Build both frames','搭建两端框架','At each location, build a flat 3 by 3 frame with eight Quantum Rings around one Quantum Link Chamber. Use the same plane for all nine blocks and keep both ends loaded.','在两个地点各搭建一个平面 3×3 结构：八个量子环围绕中央量子链接仓。九个方块须位于同一平面，两端都需要区块加载。',[2,2,3]),
('Prepare one linked pair','准备同一对奇点','Follow the installed recipe for Quantum Entangled Singularities. Keep the two items from the same generated pair together; unrelated singularities will not establish a link.','按当前整合包配方制作量子缠绕奇点，保留同次生成的一对。分别取得但不属于同一对的奇点不能建立量子连接。',[2,2,3]),
('Install and power both ends','安装奇点并为两端供电','Place one paired singularity in each central chamber. Provide startup energy at both ends, then connect the ME cables through the supported ring connection points.','将配对奇点分别放入两端中央仓，为两端提供启动能量，再从结构支持的量子环接入 ME 线缆。',[6,2,3]),
('Respect channel capacity','保留频道容量','A Quantum Bridge transports the network connection; it does not manufacture channels. Check channel settings, cable bottlenecks and controller topology. Test a terminal at the far end before connecting a whole base.','量子桥负责传输网络连接，不会生成额外频道。检查频道设置、线缆瓶颈和控制器拓扑，先在远端测试一个终端，再连接整座基地。',[5,1,3])]),
('spatial_io','networks',['spatial_pylon','spatial_io_port','spatial_storage_cell_2','spatial_storage_cell_16','spatial_storage_cell_128'],('Spatial IO and Region Exchange','空间 IO 与区域交换'),'ae2-mechanics/spatial-io.md',[
('Define a region','界定空间区域','Build a connected Spatial Pylon frame that bounds the target region. Keep the IO Port, energy supply and essential control wiring outside the volume being moved. Confirm the visible field and its dimensions.','用相连的空间塔框架界定目标区域，把空间 IO 端口、能量源及必要控制线路放在交换区域之外，并确认可见空间场和尺寸。',[2,1,2]),
('Match the spatial cell','选择合适空间元件','Insert a Spatial Storage Cell that supports the field dimensions. Normal item storage cells cannot hold a region. Keep spare space in the cell and use a small test area first.','插入能够容纳该空间场尺寸的空间存储元件。普通物品存储元件不能存储区域，首次使用先选择小型测试区域。',[1,1,4]),
('Supply the operation energy','提供操作所需能量','Read the IO Port energy requirement and efficiency. Charge enough network energy cells before triggering; a powered frame alone does not guarantee sufficient stored energy for the exchange.','查看 IO 端口显示的能量需求与效率，并在触发前充足储能。框架处于供电状态不等于已存有完成交换所需的全部能量。',[1,1,3]),
('Trigger and exchange','触发并完成交换','Apply the required redstone trigger to the Spatial IO Port. It exchanges the bounded world contents with the cell contents. Remove players and irreplaceable objects before your first practical test.','向空间 IO 端口提供所需红石触发，区域中的世界内容会与元件中的内容交换。首次实测前移走玩家和不可替代的物品。',[1,1,4]),
('Verify support and restore','核对可搬移对象并还原','Some modded blocks or entities may not support spatial movement. Verify with a copied setup, then trigger the same field and cell again to restore the exchanged contents. Check chunk loading and energy each time.','部分模组方块或实体可能不支持空间搬移，先用复制的装置验证，再用同一空间场和元件再次触发还原。每次都检查区块加载与储能。',[4,3,4])]),
('planes','automation',['formation_plane','annihilation_plane'],('Formation and Annihilation Planes','成型面板与湮灭面板'),'items-blocks-machines/formation_plane.md',[
('Face the work area','朝向工作区域','Place the panel on a cable face with open space directly in front. A Formation Plane places supported resources in the world; an Annihilation Plane collects or breaks supported targets.','把面板装在线缆面上，正前方留出工作空间。成型面板将支持的资源放入世界，湮灭面板收集或破坏其支持的目标。',[4,1,2]),
('Provide storage access','提供存储访问','The plane needs a powered network and usable storage paths. For a collection subnet, route the output to a Storage Bus on the destination inventory, keeping unintended main storage disconnected.','面板需要供能网络和可用存储路线。收集子网络可通过面对目标容器的存储总线存放产物，同时与不希望接入的主网存储保持分离。',[4,1,4]),
('Control what is placed','限制成型物品','Configure the Formation Plane filter and any supported upgrades before supplying items. Test with cheap blocks and keep the work area clear so the panel cannot obstruct your control wiring.','供料前配置成型面板过滤与支持的升级。用廉价方块测试，保持工作区域清晰，避免面板把控制线或操作通道堵住。',[5,1,2]),
('Confirm real drops','核对实际掉落','Check the Annihilation Plane behavior against the target block, collection mode and installed upgrades. Test where the drops go and what happens when destination storage is full.','按目标方块、收集模式和已装升级检查湮灭面板行为，并测试掉落流向以及目标存储装满时的结果。',[5,1,4])]),
('upgrades','automation',['speed_card','capacity_card','fuzzy_card','inverter_card','crafting_card','redstone_card'],('Bus Filters and Upgrade Cards','总线过滤与升级卡'),'items-blocks-machines/upgrade_cards.md',[
('Start with the filter','先设置过滤','Configure one desired resource and test the bus direction before installing upgrades. Filter icons are ghost entries, so placing a filter does not provide the items that an Export Bus will send.','安装升级前，先配置一种资源并测试总线方向。过滤图标是虚拟标记，为输出总线设置过滤不会自动提供要输出的物品。',[5,1,3]),
('Increase capacity or speed','扩展过滤与速度','Capacity Cards add filter capacity on supported devices; Speed Cards raise transfer throughput. Their allowed count and behavior depend on the device. Use only the slots accepted by its GUI.','容量卡在支持的设备上增加过滤容量，加速卡提升传输速度。允许数量和具体行为取决于设备，应以设备界面可接受的升级为准。',[5,1,3]),
('Use fuzzy and inversion carefully','谨慎使用模糊与反相','Fuzzy and Inverter Cards change matching behavior where supported. Test with similar damaged or tagged items; a reversed filter can send a much broader set than intended.','设备支持时，模糊卡与反相卡会改变匹配方式。用损耗、标签相似的物品测试，反相过滤可能让实际通过的资源远多于预期。',[5,1,5]),
('Crafting and redstone need setup','合成与红石仍需配置','A Crafting Card requests craftable resources and still needs patterns and a CPU. A Redstone Card exposes control modes; select the desired high, low or pulse behavior after installation.','合成卡用于请求可自动合成的资源，仍需样板和 CPU。红石卡提供控制模式，安装后还要选择高电平、低电平或脉冲等所需行为。',[3,1,3])]),
('crafting_cpu','crafting',['1k_crafting_storage','4k_crafting_storage','16k_crafting_storage','64k_crafting_storage','crafting_accelerator','crafting_unit'],('Crafting CPU Size and Concurrency','合成 CPU 容量与并行'),'items-blocks-machines/crafting_cpu_multiblock.md',[
('Make a solid cuboid','搭建实心长方体','Join Crafting Storage, Co-Processing Units and optional Crafting Units into a solid cuboid. Keep different CPUs physically separate if they should execute separate jobs.','将合成存储器、并行处理单元及可选合成单元组成实心长方体。需要执行独立任务的多个 CPU，应在物理上分隔。',[3,1,1]),
('Add enough job storage','提供足够任务容量','Crafting Storage supplies bytes used by the job plan. A Co-Processing Unit or ordinary Crafting Unit is not a substitute. Read the crafting plan when a task will not fit.','合成存储器提供任务计划需要的字节容量。并行处理单元和普通合成单元不能代替存储器；任务放不下时查看合成计划的容量需求。',[2,1,1]),
('Parallelize the production path','同时扩展生产路径','Co-Processing Units let one CPU issue more operations concurrently, but machines, Pattern Providers, material stock and product-return paths must also support the throughput.','并行处理单元使同一个 CPU 能同时发出更多操作，但机器、样板供应器、原料库存与产物回网路线也必须有对应吞吐能力。',[4,1,1]),
('Watch dependencies','检查依赖关系','Recursive crafting requires a complete chain of patterns and available base ingredients. If a task waits, inspect the pending ingredient and exact returned quantity instead of only enlarging the CPU.','递归合成需要完整的样板依赖链和可用基础原料。任务等待时，检查正在等待的材料和准确回网数量，不能只靠扩大 CPU 解决。',[4,1,3])]),
('monitors_tools','basics',['storage_monitor','conversion_monitor','network_tool','certus_quartz_wrench','memory_card'],('Monitors and Network Diagnostics','监视器与网络诊断工具'),'items-blocks-machines/monitors.md',[
('Display one resource','显示单一资源','A Storage Monitor displays the configured resource count from its connected network. Configure it with the intended item and lock its selection when appropriate. It does not add storage capacity.','存储监视器显示所在网络中所选资源的数量。用目标物品配置，按需锁定选择；监视器本身不提供额外存储容量。',[3,1,3]),
('Use a conversion monitor','使用转换监视器','A Conversion Monitor also provides supported insertion and extraction interactions for the selected resource. Try with a small stack and check the terminal to confirm the result.','转换监视器还提供所选资源的交互存取操作。先用一小叠物品尝试，并通过终端核对存入或取出的结果。',[4,1,3]),
('Inspect network power','检查网络供能','Use the Network Tool on the relevant network to inspect energy and device information. Diagnose one branch at a time: power first, then cable connectivity, channels and storage space.','用网络工具检查目标网络的能量和设备信息。逐条分支排查，顺序为供电、线缆连接、频道和存储空间。',[2,1,3]),
('Rotate and copy carefully','正确使用扳手与存储卡','Use the wrench for supported rotation or dismantling. A Memory Card copies supported device settings or tunnel links; aim at the exact face and inspect its tooltip before applying it elsewhere.','用扳手执行设备支持的旋转或拆卸。存储卡可复制支持的设置或隧道连接，操作时对准准确部件面，并在应用前查看卡片提示。',[5,1,3])]),
('fluid_storage','automation',['fluid_storage_cell_1k','fluid_storage_cell_4k','fluid_storage_cell_16k','fluid_storage_cell_64k','import_bus','export_bus','storage_bus'],('Fluid Storage and Tank Automation','流体存储与储罐自动化'),'example-setups/pipe-subnet.md',[
('Use fluid-capable storage','准备流体存储','Use a fluid-capable cell or a Storage Bus facing a compatible tank. An item-only cell does not become fluid storage when you put buckets in it. Inspect the supported resource types.','使用支持流体的存储元件，或用存储总线面对兼容储罐。仅支持物品的元件不会因为存入水桶就变成流体存储，应检查支持的资源种类。',[2,1,3]),
('Configure the resource','配置目标资源','AE2S devices use their supported resource configuration. Select the desired fluid in the bus or interface configuration and test one transfer. Check which tank face exposes the fluid handler.','按 AE2S 设备支持的资源配置方式，在总线或接口中选择目标流体并测试一次传输，同时确认储罐哪个面提供流体能力。',[4,1,3]),
('Distinguish storage and transfer','区分访问与搬运','A Storage Bus exposes a tank in place; an Import Bus pulls from it, while an Export Bus sends a selected fluid to it. Keep source and destination distinct to avoid circulation.','存储总线直接暴露储罐中的内容，输入总线从储罐抽取，输出总线向其发送所选流体。明确源和目标，避免建立无意义的循环。',[5,1,3]),
('Separate a pipe subnet','建立独立运输子网络','For dedicated tank-to-tank transport, isolate a small powered subnet with an Import Bus on the source and a Storage Bus on the destination. Check capacity and resource filters before leaving it unattended.','专门的储罐间运输可用独立供能子网络：源罐输入总线、目标罐存储总线。离开前检查目标容量和资源过滤。',[3,1,3])]),
('condenser','automation',['condenser','matter_ball','singularity'],('Condenser and Matter Conversion','物质聚合器与物质转换'),'items-blocks-machines/condenser.md',[
('Keep valuables out','隔离贵重资源','The Matter Condenser consumes inserted resources for matter power. Feed it only resources you intend to destroy; keep it off unrestricted main-network export paths.','物质聚合器会消耗投入资源以积累物质能量。只投入计划销毁的资源，不要将其接到无过滤的主网输出路线。',[4,1,2]),
('Select the output mode','选择输出模式','Choose the required output mode in the GUI. Matter Balls and Singularities have different matter-power requirements; read the current interface rather than assuming one input item makes one output.','在界面选择所需产出模式。物质球和奇点需要的物质能量不同，应查看当前界面需求，不能假定一个输入直接换一个成品。',[4,1,2]),
('Install supported storage','安装支持的储能组件','Insert a supported storage component when the selected output needs accumulated matter power. A normal filled storage cell is not a safe substitute for checking the accepted component slot.','需要积累物质能量的输出模式应在指定槽位安装支持的存储组件。先核对槽位要求，不要将装有物品的存储元件当成替代品。',[4,1,2]),
('Extract and verify','提取并核对成品','Route the produced item to a separate collection inventory, then verify the next cycle. For a quantum link, the Singularity still needs the installed entangling recipe to become a paired set.','将产物送入独立收集容器，并核对下一个周期。用于量子连接的奇点还需要通过实际缠绕配方，变成配对的量子缠绕奇点。',[5,1,3])])
]

